{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1000_p", "source_sha256": "619eb3bfb94fc030e5d69b9acad22ce9f2a0f349df153461b8a28d54f95ceaad", "ja": "（PV撮影に向けて、まつりの衣装が出来上がった。\n浴衣がモチーフだが……気に入ってもらえるかな？）", "zh": "（为了拍摄PV，茉莉的服装做好了。虽然以浴衣为主题……她会喜欢吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "9ab5b341156505709cf18461220b05a9eddf44dcc3f970ca236c9ad2c8655a26", "ja": "ふふっ、今回もそーきゅーと！な衣装なのです♪\nお祭りに着ていったら、ピッタリだと姫は思うのです。", "zh": "呵呵，这次也是超可爱的服装哦♪  \n要是穿着去参加祭典，公主觉得一定非常合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "ad4a75577f5c9ba0efea4e0297144645e65a4344e7d78025a985fb39214666df", "ja": "{$P$}さん、姫はすぐにでも\n賑やかで楽しい場所に出かけたい気分なのです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，公主现在就想\n去热闹又开心的地方玩呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b765ca30488a3eae6e3b3b02347b0fc42339243a8bc74a03e5fdc38f90abd126", "ja": "わかった！　……といいたいが、今日は試着だけだ。\nでもそのお願いは、PV撮影で叶うかもしれない。", "zh": "我也很想这么说！……不过今天只是来试穿的。\n但你的愿望，说不定能在MV拍摄中实现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "85143bffc4dc7a8ee1fca6c386488836f47ceed22a19258e520df525a1647469", "ja": "ほ？　それはつまり、本当のお祭りで\nこの衣装を着れるということなのです？", "zh": "哦？也就是说，可以在真正的庆典上穿这套服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1005_p", "source_sha256": "72ce7a8872bd7ea0ace023b233b16f1dc25dbf85e5110f9ea07ee16562326964", "ja": "本当のお祭りというと語弊があるが、撮影用に\nお祭りみたいなセットを作ることになってるんだ。", "zh": "说是真正的祭典可能有些不准确，不过我们会为了拍摄搭建一个像祭典一样的布景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "3456ccbbafb9b377620825a906315fc3249adcd4eea61f3ee7c35112652148b2", "ja": "わんだほー！なのです、{$P$}さん！\nお祭りには、やっぱり可愛い浴衣がマストなのです。", "zh": "太棒啦——！{$P$}先生！\n说到祭典，果然还是可爱的浴衣最重要啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "a9db740b56fc40f149dc755f6e664312d48f9332c2c1f9d1cf514d7be27f126d", "ja": "お祭り……うう～、姫は待ち切れないのです！\nワクワクが今、まさに溢れようとしているのです。", "zh": "祭典……呜呜～，本公主已经等不及了！\n兴奋的心情，现在简直就要溢出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "247e0fdf485c6539c20ab1abfcc8fa1a2460a7cc6d3f7b1a197e7c0463d9d4aa", "ja": "ワクワクしすぎて、ワクワクが止まらないのです！\nヘルプなのです、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "太期待了，兴奋得停不下来啦！\n救命啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1009_p", "source_sha256": "00776dcb68ca21e363a0d6e0af769bc5628118d3faa6e2c959ee31d6d93c8dca", "ja": "えっ！　ヘルプと言われても、何をすればいいんだ？", "zh": "诶！就算你说要帮忙，我也不知道该做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "bad42469a5d85b98b462e686ed4d1d9a8c13c0c0e3e92d67fb654716897fb831", "ja": "今から姫がヒントを出すので、よく聞いてください。\nヒント1……今、とっても身体を動かしたいのです！", "zh": "接下来由公主来给出提示，请仔细听好。\n提示1……现在特别想活动一下身体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1c89490ce8473802e4105cf1f88e8951fb5a28df135083da86b79dcfeeb6d4ce", "ja": "体を動かす……？　うーん……？", "zh": "活动身体……？嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "6f7f6835dda170b6d12a42ee38ba4691b6904d466a915a7f6aa7839c945dc800", "ja": "それではヒント2……お城のパーティーでも\n行われていて、パートナーが必要なのです。", "zh": "那么提示2……在城堡的派对上也会进行，而且需要舞伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f55d7a5193bbf04466c0413d0682aace07599bf80667cc80203021ae30c7889e", "ja": "お城の……あっ！　もしかして、ダンス？", "zh": "城堡里的……啊！难道是跳舞？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "c94fa6e344ce3caafb37001273a3f4d7127ad08731d0ad38d653cba29fc9047c", "ja": "ぴんぽーん！　大正解なのです♪　嬉しい気持ちは\n全力で伝えないと、もったいないのです。", "zh": "叮咚！完全正确哦♪　开心的心情要是不全力传达出去，就太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "760bb8d05e4259c9e1124b7850308c2b3ddb66451b585769b8206f39fba1b0c7", "ja": "{$P$}さんは衣装を用意する時、\nたくさん姫のことを考えてくれるのですから。", "zh": "{$P$}先生准备服装的时候，\n可是花了很多心思在公主身上的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "6bcc7c346b2555cc83bf8326400c1ca98d80c21d34ee28dda0687a425b741294", "ja": "その想いに応えたいし、お礼もしたいのです。\n……というわけで、さっそく一緒に踊るのですよ～♪", "zh": "我想回应这份心意，也想向您道谢。\n……所以，我们马上一起跳舞吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1017_p", "source_sha256": "97b24d85b0289ff100e98ecc3060e9446e7bbaba18642be18e746b835db6c0eb", "ja": "き、気持ちは嬉しいけど……\nそもそも、どう踊ればいいのか……。", "zh": "虽、虽然你的心意让我很开心……  \n可是，我根本不知道该怎么跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "fac0d4983d73d1df9462c45d66f59438578fa5c054de8e48398021bc9f2f69ec", "ja": "大丈夫なのです！　踊りは心で楽しむものなのですよ。\nさあ、覚悟を決めて……姫の魔法で一緒に踊るのです！", "zh": "没关系的！跳舞本来就是用心去享受的事情哦。\n来，下定决心……在公主的魔法下一起来跳舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0484_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "63bdfc4428625573308298387e5428d1dffdb44ad1cf302b9d1ee749c5c69562", "ja": "くるくる～……みらくる～……わんだほーっ♪", "zh": "转呀转～……奇迹呀～……精彩绝伦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
